EVERYTHING IS SAVED TO  /workspace/session/20260901T214218Z/tuned_vs_fallback/f3df6fed9e30
  rows   /workspace/session/20260901T214218Z/tuned_vs_fallback/f3df6fed9e30/timings.csv
